# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add Cursor, cursoragent, or any AI tool as a commit author, committer, or co-author.

- Do **not** pass `git commit --trailer` with `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `cursoragent@cursor.com`
- Do **not** put `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` in commit messages
- Do **not** put `Made with Cursor` in commit or PR bodies
- Author/committer must remain the user's git identity only (Fullstack Mechanic / SirhmVFX)
- If a commit message somehow includes a Cursor co-author line, remove it before committing
